	You are set on a journey, through the jungles, to find an
	alchemist that can set you free from the curse.
## Gameplay:
	You will fight monsters, do parkour ( hint: pogos exist! ), and more!!
	You can change controls from the settings menu..
## Creators
	[Hazoro](https://github.com/hazorox), [Vii](https://github.com/vii-abdullatif), and [AboEl5yr](https://github.com/adhammohamedkhairy)
	<3                                  <3																<3					<3

